QvRznLsRfzqiaM3uSll0fKxZyicvhY84BJxvePJ47lFurncrmPiaU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T09:37:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268613:2","title":"解读 | 以中国之治探索回应智能时代之问——《人工智能安全治理框架3.0》解读","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268613&idx=2&sn=20c985d9fd293f99ee9236dca1045c47&chksm=8a9796ff4d9b3c8a5488106318835f5ce2328a42ad5516f01ed7e2bc34ca9a00d7f5d121ddc1&scene=126&sessionid=1795076099#rd","description":"2026年7月17日，习近平主席在上海世界会客厅出席2026世界人工智能大会暨人工智能全球治理高级别会议开幕式并发表主旨讲话。面对奔涌而来的人工智能浪潮，习近平主席以四个“时代之问”点出治理挑战：“当机器开始思考，人类如何与之相处？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CiaQbNlFicMib9jwYd8Oib6lpbClryVRYvYggRibR40AlRRr2gpPxY8NpSyzXVqdxLTkiaG3d3JGDDH0pKpuLibNtfNHtEs4G1a7RPR1Q%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T09:37:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268613:3","title":"观点 | 促进互联网信息内容多渠道分发服务规范健康发展","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268613&idx=3&sn=8912dea94fac47fc5dc2bc08cb1dce30&chksm=8aad81fd17c04b349dde420931c33622b99826bc77446a5cf7b9f5fe39b2e01525df8aea9978&scene=126&sessionid=1795076099#rd","description":"《互联网信息内容多渠道分发服务管理规定》明确规定互联网信息内容多渠道分发服务机构应当依法办理经营主体登记，平台建立分类分级管理制度。这标志着互联网信息内容多渠道分发服务正式进入制度化监管阶段，为维护网络内容生态秩序提供了明确的制度依据。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CianckUVWazFKWa2iavkib9wiapCa9FF7U610HB7PWHYvU9DFe2M1GGTdKUMu1QCrxWmmUAnK9dKVQk5kOvib1HwHK9ibDic4TlBfGehk%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T09:37:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268613:4","title":"评论 | AI玩梗要守好虚实边界","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268613&idx=4&sn=734097871e9cedb40744985b456d4d04&chksm=8a540a7fd733deafa2925a814db49c400c50ad97ac9a098cfb23aa42fb7e346e7acc36cb4cdb&scene=126&sessionid=1795076099#rd","description":"AI玩梗，是年轻人开展文化再表达的一种新尝试。监控固定机位、纪实抓拍的视角，打破了课本、插画、影视剧改编的固有范式，用戏谑解构的方式激活经典文本。创作门槛降低，亲近感随之上升。年轻人在轻松的笑声里重温典故，文脉传播也找到了新的入口。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20ChzdAZAYCkOMIib9O8BVkkEeBkvDBBuicD1qh4mvu54emeUnWBPS8Hf6m56BgXI1rYMXVsOPmlSbgRlKYMUnnvzYzNCib04dxCR94%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T09:37:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268582:1","title":"专题·原创 | 低空智联网可信身份安全体系研究","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268582&idx=1&sn=a3289a1d9ec42db1158b47226e6a9774&chksm=8ae57e973212c5636fcb7612cad957e1e3192ef4e24777517d896a363fe3b16f13fcf22f970d&scene=126&sessionid=1795076099#rd","description":"为实现低空运行安全，需要对航空器、运营主体和飞行活动建立有效的识别与管理机制，身份信息成为设备接入、运行识别、任务授权和事后追溯的重要依据。一旦身份凭证被冒用、关联关系失效或权限被不当扩大，网络平台即使能够接收到相关数据……","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20Cgiaqz29zNEgJlkyvP4s6FpDWKKiaBOR8MSKMlcF6SwAxtQz3Ap6TVjAdO9nNJ3TKG1ZI65YWD072FsOsfuH29avdcSfaEObzejg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-17T10:10:20.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268582:2","title":"前沿 | 国际人工智能治理新趋势对国家安全的影响及应对策略","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268582&idx=2&sn=f5f3992a50453ac995390585ae955dd6&chksm=8a030bc5d7e93e9aacb71c1275c29bc4ae9fc1cc1bc920ec866363cbf78f001136fcb5fb83d7&scene=126&sessionid=1795076099#rd","description":"当前，人工智能（AI）治理已成为塑造未来产业竞争优势、维护国家安全和公共利益的重要议题。近期，美国、英国、新加坡等国家聚焦AI智能体、生成式AI测试、前沿模型评估等重点方向，密集出台多项举措，推动国际人工智能治理由原则倡议向测试验证……","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CgLqu4dswBvx7qzDcib0ywq5icw8joRHSWicBHRuwAURlpypAeO0gQD4vkdW1NJV6DuwvqticnAjqeHPwwugCzERJgiarnB9b01oeNY%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-17T10:10:20.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268582:3","title":"观点 | 以开源开放抵制“数字铁幕”","link":"http://mp.weixin